<Prose title="Contact" eyebrow="Say hello" description="Contact Electroys with product suggestions, corrections or partnership questions.">
  <p class="lead">We read every message. Product suggestions, corrections and questions are all welcome.</p>
  <p style="font-size:1.25rem"><a href="mailto:myelectroys@gmail.com"><strong>myelectroys@gmail.com</strong></a></p>
  <h2>Helpful things to include</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Corrections:</strong> the product page link and what looks wrong.</li>
    <li><strong>Gift help:</strong> the age, interests and budget. Or try the <a href="/finder/">Kit Finder</a> for an instant answer.</li>
    <li><strong>Brands & partnerships:</strong> we never charge for placement. Tell us about your product and we’ll consider it on the same criteria as everything else.</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="muted">Please don’t send sensitive personal information by email. Orders, shipping and returns are handled by the retailer you bought from.</p>
</Prose>
